The WSOLA engine in this directory follows the yae audio tempo filter from
the aeyae project: yae/ffmpeg/yae_audio_tempo_filter.h,
yae/ffmpeg/yae_audio_fragment.h and yae/ffmpeg/yae_audio_track.cpp
(https://github.com/pkoshevoy/aeyae, commit 7e01117). Each of those files
states "Copyright: Pavel Koshevoy, License: MIT" and points to
